        target="_blank"
        >KafkaJS client configuration</a
      >)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>consumer</code></td>
    <td>Consumer configuration options (see the
      <a
        href="https://kafka.js.org/docs/consuming#a-name-options-a-options"
        rel="nofollow"
        target="_blank"
        >KafkaJS consumer options</a
      >)</td>
